{"id":"cooperacio_n","lemma":"cooperación","pos":"noun","rank":3776,"glosses":["cooperation"],"ipa":"/koopeɾaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cooperaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cooperaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito tu cooperación.","en":"I need your cooperation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501156","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Contamos con su cooperación.","en":"We're counting on your cooperation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734050","words":[{"g":"to count","l":"contar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Muchas gracias en adelanto por tu cooperación.","en":"Thank you in advance for your cooperation.","words":[null,null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"progress"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"Thank you very much"]]},{"text":"Sin tu cooperación, no habría podido terminar el trabajo a tiempo.","en":"If I hadn't had your cooperation, I couldn't have finished the work in time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609064","words":[{"g":"without"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to finish"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"},null,null],"phrases":[[9,11,"in time"]]},{"text":"Su empleador estaba sinceramente agradecido por su cooperación.","en":"His employer was sincerely grateful for his cooperation.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"that employs"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"sincerely"},{"g":"grateful"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}